2026-08-07T19:04:26.5037022Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-08-07T19:04:26.5037303Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-08-07T19:04:26.5037431Z i /tmp/RtmpWLtYSy/duckdb.dev
2026-08-07T19:04:26.5037585Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-08-07T19:04:26.5037752Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-08-07T19:04:26.5037859Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-08-07T19:04:26.5038213Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-08-07T19:04:26.5038639Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-08-07T19:04:26.5038824Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-08-07T19:04:26.5039000Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-08-07T19:04:26.5039169Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-08-07T19:04:26.5039330Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-08-07T19:04:26.5039605Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
